        &lt;h2 id=&#34;what-is-spinnaker&#34;&gt;What is Spinnaker?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spinnaker is an open source Continuous Delivery platform developed by Netflix that supports multicloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It supports most major cloud providers, including Google Cloud, Amazon, and Microsoft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It supports open source cloud or container platforms such as Kubernetes and OpenStack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
